  "description": "The OXVA XLIM Pro 3 Pod Vape Kit refines OXVA’s popular pod series with a powerful 1500mAh battery, a crisp 1.05-inch HD screen, and versatile performance in a slim, ergonomic form. Designed for both mouth-to-lung (MTL) and restricted direct-to-lung (RDL) vaping, it offers up to 30W of adjustable power with the reassurance of the advanced PHOTON CHIP, helping to maintain consistent output and flavour even as battery levels fall. Everyday usability is at the forefront of the XLIM Pro 3. The kit supports both auto-draw and button activation, while a practical side airflow slider makes it easy to fine-tune the draw to your preference. T op-fill XLIM pods are designed for convenience, allowing quick refills without mess, and the device is compatible with the full XLIM pod family as well as EZ pods , giving vapers plenty of coil options to explore. The XLIM Pro 3 comes with two pods to get you started: a 0.6ohm pod for a stronger, warmer vape with lower nicotine strengths, and a 0.8ohm pod ideal for Nic Salts and higher nicotine e-liquids. Together with fast USB-C 2A charging and a comfortable design available in a range of finishes, the XLIM Pro 3 is a versatile pod vape kit that adapts to your style of vaping. Check out our vape juices and pair them perfectly with this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
